                                "sense_id": "2a2b6d60-10af-3358-a422-b9cc50e2fb6e",
                                "text": "Comparing the ensilage of this season with that produced during the past five years at the station, we can safely say that this ensilage was by far the best yet made at this station."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b24b217d-673a-455a-b015-a2ea4010780b",
                                "sense_id": "2a2b6d60-10af-3358-a422-b9cc50e2fb6e",
                                "text": "An American paper, is summarising the value of ensilage, says that twenty years' experience in the use of the silo has brought out some facts about which all are agreed."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
